 "🔑 <b>Unlocked.</b> The Editor creator and every city editor are yours — Creator Studio → 🎭 Editors.": "🔑 <b>已解锁。</b>主办人创作器和所有城市主办人都归你了——创作工坊 → 🎭 主办人。",
 "🎶 All sixteen themes are yours — the twelve cities and the four others. Settings → Audio.": "🎶 全部十六首主题曲都归你了——十二座城市和另外四首。设置 → 音频。",
