 "🔑 Words of power": "🔑 力量之词",
 "Cheats. Press <b>C</b> on the main menu (on a phone or tablet: hold the version badge) and speak one. They stay hidden until you ask.": "作弊码。在主菜单按<b>C</b>（手机或平板上：长按版本标记），然后说出一个词。在你要求之前它们始终隐藏。",
