 "Flavius": "Flavius",
 "The city’s seated editor (default)": "该城市的现任主办人（默认）",
 "🎭 Today's games are given by <b>{0}</b>, editor of the games{1}.": "🎭 今日赛会由赛会主办人<b>{0}</b>{1}举办。",
 "🎭 <b>{0}</b>, editor of {1}, is unlocked — seat them in Settings → Editors to have them give the games there": "🎭 {1}的主办人<b>{0}</b>已解锁——在设置 → 主办人中让其就座，即可由其在该城举办赛会",
 "🎭 You have won in all twelve cities — the <b>Editor creator</b> is open in the Creator Studio!": "🎭 你已在全部十二座城市获胜——创作工坊中的<b>主办人创作器</b>已开放！",
 "🔑 <b>Developer’s key turned</b> — every editor and the Editor creator are open regardless of wins.": "🔑 <b>开发者钥匙已转动</b>——无论胜负，所有主办人和主办人创作器均已开放。",
 "The <b>editor of the games</b> is the face in the framed box over the arena — the one who pays for the games, and the rulebook's own word for them. Flavius edits every city's games to begin with; <b>win a match as a human player</b> at a city and its own editor is <b>unlocked</b> — pick them for that city below to seat them in the box (and their name replaces Flavius in the herald’s lines). Win at all twelve and the <b>Editor creator</b> opens in the Creator Studio.": "<b>赛会主办人</b>就是竞技场上方画框里的那张脸——为赛会出钱的人，也是规则书本身对他们的称呼。起初每座城市的赛会都由Flavius主办；在某座城市<b>以真人玩家身份赢下一场比赛</b>，该城自己的主办人就会<b>解锁</b>——在下方为那座城市选择他们，让其坐进画框（传令官台词中的Flavius也会换成他们的名字）。在全部十二座城市获胜后，创作工坊中的<b>主办人创作器</b>就会开放。",
 "({0}/12 cities won)": "（已在{0}/12座城市获胜）",
